  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Before treasure yellow heaven opens, while Lang Ya Sect suppresses his aperture development, Fang Yuan deduces the immortal killer move Bloodstained Conqueror’s Robe to cover his greatest weakness, defense. His wisdom path and blood path grandmaster attainment, plus his previous life’s blood path foundation, make creating the move comparatively easy. With Blood Asset Immortal Gu as the core, blood stains on his robe are the move in battle. Against Zhou Min’s farsight weapon light he charges through uninjured, and immortal essence spend falls as he closes because the light weakens at short range.",
      "chapters": [
        1126
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_blood_asset_immortal_gu",
        "char_zhou_min"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan uses sword escape with giant hand charges against ancient eagle hounds, he activates the robe beforehand to cover the risk of that close-range tactic. Mid-chase, three breaths future vision shows a third ancient eagle hound ambush in which the robe breaks, Blood Asset is injured and cannot be used again, and his body is smashed with fractured bones and blood from the seven orifices; he trusts that vision and avoids the ambush. He rates the move as immortal level defense, but with only rank six Blood Asset as the core he still finds it slightly weak against an ancient desolate beast.",
      "chapters": [
        1136
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limit-against-ancient-desolate-beasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He still lists bloodstained conqueror’s robe among his defensive methods, calling it originally his own method that he used for some time. Even though the core Immortal Gu is then rank seven, he treats a rank seven method as useless in that rank eight fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
